# W31f, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land, b joins in stag0201; a goes into dng204b1 alone (matz01), waits there until b's
# notice ran out, then goes home by the Gate Disk (the host's way home: "Your guests will return to their lobbies."):
# the instance ends (host_left).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until present=2,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@400 fail stagechange
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@700
log a in dng204b1
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=600
idle until frames>=2400 fail present>=2
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@950
log a home
idle until frames>=300
